  "howto": {
    "what": "装上后,Claude 面对需要查数据库的问题时,会先锁定你要查的对象和条件,从已收录的 78 个公开数据库中挑一个,调用它的查询接口取数,核对数量无误后,把结果连同数据来源、查询参数和查询日期一起给你。",
    "when": "当你提出科学、监管、金融等需要查数据库获取有出处事实的问题,而不是凭常识猜时,技能会触发。例如问化合物的化学式、某地区的地震记录或某基因的序列。",
    "say": [
      {
        "text": "帮我查一下阿司匹林的化学式和 SMILES 串。",
        "note": "会从 PubChem 等数据库取数,返回结果并附来源。"
      },
      {
        "text": "查最近一周加州 USGS 记录的 3 级以上地震。",
        "note": "会列出地震事件,含时间、地点与震级。"
      },
      {
        "text": "从 UniProt 查出人源 TP53 的蛋白序列和功能注释。",
        "note": "返回 UniProt 条目,附序列、注释和链接。"
      }
    ],
    "source": "llm",
    "content_hash": "sha256:2b88d7e0d6f0a32b6578370acbe6d43cf9a6bc87d277d0858a3e4cd858790276",
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_at": "2026-09-08T08:07:20.003Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "This skill makes Claude turn database-backed queries into reproducible retrievals: it picks the authoritative database(s) from a catalog of 78, makes bounded API calls, reconciles counts, and returns answers with source, endpoint and access date.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when the user asks for a scientific, regulatory, financial or other database-backed fact that should be retrieved from a named source, e.g. compound properties, seismic events or gene annotations.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Look up aspirin and tell me its chemical formula and SMILES.",
        "note": "Queries PubChem etc. and returns the result with a source."
      },
      {
        "text": "List USGS earthquakes of magnitude 3+ near California in the past week.",
        "note": "Returns events with time, location and magnitude."
      },
      {
        "text": "Get the protein sequence and functional annotations for human TP53 from UniProt.",
        "note": "Returns the entry with sequence, annotations and link."
      }
    ]
